	)
	(text "This limits the current to 0.87A.\nThis limit prevents a short on the CAN bus\nfrom passing too much current over CAN_V+ and\nruining the wires. \nA CAT6 22AWG can carry ~0.9A - 3A or more\ndepending on conditions."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 35.052 95.504 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "03f1a6d6-ca14-4d5e-8e2f-e60218c26acc")
	)
	(text "CAN trunk and 24 V feed to the\nsix RJ45 ports on sheet 2"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 229.108 128.778 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "10d1db30-f088-440f-bc02-f0f41bb2f74c")
	)
	(text "Q9 - Services the switch, turn CAN_V+ on/off\nQ10 - reverse polarity + reverse current blocking FET\nQ11 - fast gate pull-down for Q10"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 63.246 49.53 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "67cbc6f8-33a4-46c0-8650-a08196e4eaa5")
	)
	(text "24V CAN BUS POWER  ->  CAN_V+ = RJ2 pin 8\n(24 V return on pin 7, its CAT5 pair mate)\nThe 24 V supply MUST be floating - its negative\nbecomes CAN_GND, the isolated side of the\nADM3057E barrier. Earthing it defeats isolation.\nQ10 is the reverse-blocking FET (S=IN_SYS, D=IN,\nG=BGATE); Q11 is the fast gate pull-down from\nDRV. That pair gives reverse-polarity AND\nreverse-current blocking. C95/D41 sit on OUT, so\na reversed supply cannot forward-bias the TVS\nor the electrolytic."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 107.696 141.732 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "67f5664d-b046-43c9-9400-442e3e9d2de1")
	)
	(text "CAN Termination 1 (fit both shunts)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 59.69 108.204 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.032 2.032)
			)
		)
		(uuid "af54083b-a5b3-4320-b05f-51fa4302e75e")
	)
	(text "CAN Termination 2 (fit both shunts)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 33.02 158.75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.032 2.032)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "bc1bd0e4-3cc9-4f87-8fc3-a12ccd9a1f4a")
	)
	(text "CAN 24V (CAN_V+) - Current limiting, On/OFF switch, Reverse polarity protection"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 33.274 36.83 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.032 2.032)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "bf2393ec-e33c-455b-8308-fbe77c4bf4df")
	)
	(text "Place D42 close to IN_SYS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 99.822 97.79 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "c03920f0-434b-4f8d-8c12-1035d97526a8")
	)
	(text "R104 51k sets I_OL = 0.87 A typ (0.78-0.96 A over\nthe +/-10 % spec). The eFuse REGULATES at I_OL.\nPGTH to GND holds PGOOD low, disabling the\n1.5x I_OL pulse allowance, so the 22 AWG CAT6\npair (0.92 A) is never exceeded.\nUVLO to GND = internal 15.4/14.6 V lockout.\nMODE to GND enables ILIM open/short detect.\nC96 100nF on dVdT = ~50 ms ramp, ~0.11 A inrush\ninto C95. SHDN floats high = enabled. \nR101/R102 halve Q9 gate drive to\n-12 V: DMP6023LE VGS limit is +/-20 V.\nLED5 lights when SW3 is on = bus powered."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 108.458 179.832 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "dc070c9f-f9aa-4930-abe4-ee31c27557bf")
	)
	(text "Termination - the hub can present\n0, 1 or 2 x 120 ohm across the bus.\nFit BOTH shunts of a header, or\nNEITHER: one shunt on its own leaves\na lop-sided half-termination.\n\nT1+T2  60 ohm - the hub IS the whole\n       bus, i.e. all six cables are\n       short stubs off this board.\nT1     120 ohm - the hub sits at ONE\n       end of a longer bus that is\n       terminated at its far end.\nnone   the hub sits in the MIDDLE of\n       a bus terminated elsewhere."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 105.918 106.934 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f4f40db1-1273-4602-bbfe-db42211ef1c4")
	)
	(text "CAN Bus Hub"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.546 21.082 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 5.08 5.08)
			)
		)
		(uuid "f6013f6b-7934-4800-bc23-1fd66ddcb6cf")
	)
	(text "Power supply suggestion - 24VDC@1.5A\nsuch as the Mean Well LRS-35-24"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 35.052 87.122 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "f87f0cef-3f70-4a4c-84b2-45065dc8d3c1")
	)
	(text "Q9 = P-FET high-side switch for CAN_V+.\nSW3 closed -> R101/R102 hold the gate at\n12 V, VGS = -12 V, Q9 ON (LED5 lights).\nSW3 open -> R101 pulls gate to source,\nVGS = 0, Q9 OFF."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 153.67 45.466 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "fde27e3a-18da-466f-83c4-9ad266c98769")
	)
